    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d764">

                <pb facs="1087" n="1067" xml:id="pg1067"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/11–650: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Douglas</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-11-06T18:00:00+00:00">November 6, 1950—6
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 6—4:12 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2623. Text Secretary’s message to Bevin (Deptel 2344, November 6 repeated USUN 478) as forwarded via British Embassy,
                    received FonOff 11 a. m. today. FonOff has drafted telegram to Washington
                    stating (1) UK accepts U.S. resolution on Chinese intervention (Deptel 477 to
                        USUN repeated London 2343)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d764-f1"/> with slight modifications and will be co-sponsor, and (2)
                    Bevin will reply separately to Secretary’s message as soon as it can be
                    carefully studied.</p>
                <p>Department pass USUN as London 43.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Douglas</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
